      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;사회적 책임과 지속 가능성에 대한 우리의 접근 
    &lt;div id=&#34;사회적-책임과-지속-가능성에-대한-우리의-접근&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#%ec%82%ac%ed%9a%8c%ec%a0%81-%ec%b1%85%ec%9e%84%ea%b3%bc-%ec%a7%80%ec%86%8d-%ea%b0%80%eb%8a%a5%ec%84%b1%ec%97%90-%eb%8c%80%ed%95%9c-%ec%9a%b0%eb%a6%ac%ec%9d%98-%ec%a0%91%ea%b7%bc&#34; aria-label=&#34;앵커&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
